#: ../../histogram.rst:4
msgid "Histogram"
msgstr "Histogram"

#: ../../histogram.rst:5
msgid ""
"Here you will find the guide to every parameter of the histogram. If you "
"need more generic information please see :ref:`basic_usage`."
msgstr ""
"Hier kun je de handleiding voor iedere parameter van het histogram "
"vinden. Indien je meer generieke informatie zoekt, zie :ref:`basic_usage`"

#: ../../histogram.rst:12
msgid "Plot Properties"
msgstr "Diagram eigenschappen"

#: ../../histogram.rst:13
msgid "``Layer``: the combobox will display all the vector layers loaded in QGIS"
msgstr "``Layer``: de keuzelijst toont alle in QGIS ingeladen vector lagen"

#: ../../histogram.rst:15
msgid ""
"``X``: the values in this field will be binned and the count in each bin "
"will be represented as the length of the bars"
msgstr ""

#: ../../histogram.rst:18
msgid ""
"``Marker Color``: the color of the bars. To use different colors for "
"individual bars, enter an expression that returns an array of color "
"definition strings with as many elements as there are bars"
msgstr ""

#: ../../histogram.rst:22
msgid "For example ::"
msgstr ""

#: ../../histogram.rst:27
msgid "or, to use colors from a color ramp ::"
msgstr ""

#: ../../histogram.rst:36
msgid "``Stroke Color``: border color"
msgstr "``Stroke Color``: kleur van de lijn"

#: ../../histogram.rst:38
msgid "``Stroke Width``: the width of the border"
msgstr "``Stroke Width``: de dikte van de rand"

#: ../../histogram.rst:40
msgid "``Transparency``: transparency level of the bar"
msgstr "``Transparency``: transparantieniveau van de staaf"

#: ../../histogram.rst:43
msgid "Plot Customizations"
msgstr "Diagram aanpassingen"

#: ../../histogram.rst:44
msgid "``Show Legend``: show the legend of the current plot"
msgstr "``Show Legend``: toon de legenda van het huidige diagram"

#: ../../histogram.rst:46
msgid "``Horizontal Legend``: check if you want to have an horizontal legend"
msgstr "``Horizontal Legend``:  vink aan voor een horizontale legenda"

#: ../../histogram.rst:48
msgid "``Plot Title``: the plot title"
msgstr "``Plot Title``: titel van het diagram"

#: ../../histogram.rst:50
msgid "``Legend Title``: the title of the legend"
msgstr "``Legend Title``: de titel van de legenda"

#: ../../histogram.rst:52
msgid "``X Label``: X label text"
msgstr "``X Label``: X label tekst"

#: ../../histogram.rst:54
msgid "``Invert X Axis``: check if you want to invert the ordering of the x axis"
msgstr ""
"``Invert X Axis``: vink aan wanneer je de sortering van de X-as wilt "
"omdraaien "

#: ../../histogram.rst:56
msgid "``Invert Y Axis``: check if you want to invert the ordering of the y axis"
msgstr ""
"``Invert Y Axis``: vink aan wanneer je de sortering van de Y-as wilt "
"omdraaien "

#: ../../histogram.rst:58
msgid ""
"``Bar Orientation``: the orientation of the bar, either *Horizontal* or "
"*Vertical*"
msgstr ""
"``Bar Orientation``:  de oriëntatie van de staaf, *horizontaal* of "
"*verticaal*"

#: ../../histogram.rst:60
msgid "``Bar Mode``: choose if you want to group, stack or overlay the data"
msgstr ""
"``Bar Mode``: kies of je wilt groeperen, stapelen of de data over elkaar "
"wilt leggen"

#: ../../histogram.rst:62
msgid "``Normalization``: different type of bins calculations are available"
msgstr ""
"``Normalization``:  verschillende mogelijkheden voor het berekenen van "
"klassen zijn beschikbaar"

#: ../../histogram.rst:64
msgid ""
"``Cumulative Histogram``: check if you want to create a cumulative "
"histogram"
msgstr ""

#: ../../histogram.rst:66
msgid ""
"``Invert Histogram Direction``: check if you want to invert the histogram"
" direction (only if cumulative option is chosen)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../histogram.rst:68
msgid ""
"``Choose manually the bins``: check if want to choose manually the bins "
"number and add a numeric value in the box"
msgstr ""
"``Choose manually the bins``: vink aan wanneer je handmatig de klassen "
"wilt kiezen en vul een numerieke waarde in."

#: ../../histogram.rst:74
msgid ""
"``Bar gap``: choose the space between the gaps, from 0 (no space) to 1 "
"(maximum space)"
msgstr ""

